<p>Create a radius three anti-teleport field for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns and daze all enemies in the area of effect for two turns.</p><p>Enemies attempting to teleport while anchored take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">70, 94, 113, 129, 143</acronym> physical and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">70, 94, 113, 129, 143</acronym> temporal (warp) damage.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>